    <div id="tab-bridge" class="tab-content">
        <textarea id="cfg-bridge" class="smsups-textarea" spellcheck="false"><?= $bridge_config_content ?></textarea>
        <div>
            <button class="smsups-btn" onclick="saveConfig('bridge', 'cfg-bridge')">&#128190; Save &amp; Restart</button>
            <button class="smsups-btn" onclick="svcAction('bridge', 'start')">&#9654; Start</button>
            <button class="smsups-btn danger" onclick="svcAction('bridge', 'stop')">&#9632; Stop</button>
            <button class="smsups-btn" onclick="svcAction('bridge', 'restart')">&#8635; Restart</button>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div id="tab-logrotate" class="tab-content">
        <p>Rotation rules for <code>/var/log/ups-metrics.log</code> and <code>/var/log/smsups-bridge.log</code> (applied to <code>/etc/logrotate.d/smsups</code>, run daily by cron).</p>
        <textarea id="cfg-logrotate" class="smsups-textarea" spellcheck="false"><?= $logrotate_content ?></textarea>
        <div>
            <button class="smsups-btn" onclick="saveConfig('logrotate', 'cfg-logrotate')">&#128190; Save &amp; Apply</button>
        </div>
